.TH AMATL 1 "August 2026" "amatl 0.1.0-rc.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
amatl \- generalist multi-source search
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amatl
[\fB--config-file\fR \fIPATH\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
AMATL searches multiple governed sources through one Rust core. Search remains
lightweight; Deep enrichment, persistence, Trafilatura and Chromium are optional.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B search
Run the lightweight multi-provider search pipeline.
.TP
.B deep
Run Search followed by bounded document enrichment and evidence extraction.
.TP
.B ingest
Extract evidence from one explicit local file.
.TP
.B providers
List sources, their governance record and availability.
.TP
.B provider-canary
Exercise exactly one provider over the network and prove it is usable. It fails
closed before connecting when the source is not enabled, is not registered, does
not authorize a network canary, has an incomplete or expired governance record,
or lacks its credential. Network access also requires a
\fB[data_policy]\fR section whose egress is governed; omitting that section
leaves egress denied and the canary reports \fBprovider_not_approved\fR.
.TP
.B config, cache, doctor
Inspect effective configuration and local capabilities.
.TP
.B history, saved
Read the local search history and the documents saved for reuse.
.TP
.B db
SQLite maintenance: health, backups, restore, downgrade and circuit breakers.
.TP
.B benchmark
Run the built-in ranking or operational benchmarks.
.TP
.B serve
Start the loopback UI, REST API and MCP surface.
.TP
.B mcp
MCP surface commands.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, including \fBpartial_success\fR with usable results. 1 when the
operation fails or is refused before completing (unknown command, invalid
configuration, every provider failing, no usable results); the failing
\fBerror_code\fR is written to standard error.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I amatl.toml
Optional configuration file. Secrets must be supplied through environment variables.
.SH SECURITY
The default server binds to loopback and requires a bearer token. A non-loopback
bind requires authentication and TLS. See SECURITY.md and the project documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://github.com/IA-Alex/amatl
